{
  "lines": {
    "odette_2_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Oh, it is you. Come in out of the road.",
    "odette_2_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I keep meaning to ask how the farm is doing.",
    "odette_2_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Busy, but good.",
    "odette_2_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Tired, honestly.",
    "odette_2_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Good. Busy is how a farm should be.",
    "odette_2_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then sit a minute. The shop will keep.",
    "odette_2_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Take these. They are going soft on the shelf.",
    "odette_6_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Shows the shop's old ledger and the first jar she sold.",
    "odette_6_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Do you have a moment?",
    "odette_6_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Of course.",
    "odette_6_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I should be going, but go on.",
    "odette_6_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Thank you. That means a lot.",
    "odette_6_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then I will be quick.",
    "odette_6_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Here, I want you to have this.",
    "odette_rain4_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Closes the shutters early and tells how the shop got through a flood.",
    "odette_rain4_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Do you have a moment?",
    "odette_rain4_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Of course.",
    "odette_rain4_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I should be going, but go on.",
    "odette_rain4_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Thank you. That means a lot.",
    "odette_rain4_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then I will be quick.",
    "odette_rain4_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Here, I want you to have this."
  },
